dockpulse (0.12.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Version 0.12.0 release:
    - Decomposed monolithic internal/monitor package into modular sub-packages: docker, compose, swarm, system, and prune
    - Implemented thin backward-compatible monitor facade preserving existing public API
    - Decomposed monitor tests and added comprehensive sub-package test suites
    - Introduced testutil fixtures and builders for test entities
    - Modularized TUI view test suites
    - Added macOS and FreeBSD cross-compilation target coverage in CI

 -- Andrey Vorobev <Andrey.Vorobev.AQA@gmail.com>  Thu, 19 Nov 2026 23:41:53 +0300

dockpulse (0.11.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Version 0.11.1 release:
    - Fixed integer overflow vulnerabilities in byte counter and shell key mapping (G115)
    - Added FormatUintBytes supporting full uint64 ranges up to exabytes
    - Fixed path traversal and unhandled errors in socket and stats modules (G703, G104)
    - Made all tabs responsive to terminal width with dynamic column stretching
    - Redesigned Images, Networks, and Volumes details cards with consistent boxed layouts

 -- Andrey Vorobev <Andrey.Vorobev.AQA@gmail.com>  Tue, 17 Nov 2026 00:32:15 +0300

dockpulse (0.11.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Version 0.11.0 release:
    - Added dedicated Docker Images inventory tab (Tab 2)
    - Added image repository, tag, ID, size, created date, and digest views
    - Added image in-use, unused, and dangling status indicators
    - Added real-time search and filter for local images
    - Added safe image removal modal with in-use container warnings
    - Updated CLI --tab option and keybindings to support 6 tabs

 -- Andrey Vorobev <Andrey.Vorobev.AQA@gmail.com>  Mon, 16 Nov 2026 16:32:16 +0300

dockpulse (0.10.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Version 0.10.0 release:
    - Added an embedded PTY-backed terminal inside the Dockpulse interface
    - Added responsive split-pane and compact terminal layouts
    - Added explicit terminal focus, exit, and close keyboard controls
    - Kept the full-screen external shell as a fallback option
    - Added terminal lifecycle, rendering, resize, and race coverage

 -- Andrey Vorobev <Andrey.Vorobev.AQA@gmail.com>  Thu, 12 Nov 2026 23:53:30 +0300

dockpulse (0.9.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Version 0.9.0 release:
    - Removed the host metrics page and made Containers the default tab
    - Added a persistent Docker status summary above every tab
    - Added read-only Docker Networks and Volumes inventory tabs
    - Added Docker Engine API discovery with safe Docker CLI fallbacks
    - Updated navigation, CLI tab selection, tests, and documentation

 -- Andrey Vorobev <Andrey.Vorobev.AQA@gmail.com>  Thu, 12 Nov 2026 17:25:13 +0300

dockpulse (0.8.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Version 0.8.0 release:
    - Removed Russian localization and locale auto-detection
    - Standardized the UI, CLI, diagnostics, and documentation on English
    - Removed --lang, -l, and DOCKPULSE_LANG support as a breaking change
    - Refactored TUI and monitor modules with more reliable Docker-free tests
    - Updated static Linux builds, contribution tooling, and GitHub Actions

